== Mathematical typesetting examples
The formulas below illustrate mathematical typesetting with KaTeX.
They are illustrative examples, not statements of a particular research result.

=== A quadratic minimization problem
For a symmetric positive definite matrix $Q \in \mathbb{R}^{n\times n}$
and a vector $b \in \mathbb{R}^{n}$, consider
\(
    \min_{x \in \mathbb{R}^{n}}\; \frac{1}{2}x^{\mathsf T}Qx - b^{\mathsf T}x.
\)
Its unique minimizer is $x^{\star} = Q^{-1}b$.

=== A normal probability density
If $X \sim \mathcal{N}(\mu,\sigma^2)$ with $\sigma>0$, its density is
\(
    p(x) = \frac{1}{\sigma\sqrt{2\pi}}
    \exp\!\left(-\frac{(x-\mu)^2}{2\sigma^2}\right).
\)

